		},
		{
			"id": "6f9b5ed80a242170",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -2720,
			"y": 765,
			"width": 1472,
			"height": 329,
			"label": "題目"
		},
		{
			"id": "86693aeddfc86b36",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "基本上跟 Hardware Friendly 一樣",
			"x": -220,
			"y": 2400,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bd5a088428855e7f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Seq 的電路他的成本就是比較低，速度慢",
			"x": -284,
			"y": 880,
			"width": 504,
			"height": 73,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "9cea03c6b8f8b4f8",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/01-題目 - ANS 1,4.png",
			"x": -2701,
			"y": 846,
			"width": 761,
			"height": 229
		},
		{
			"id": "a399bb05076d6efd",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/16-計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算.png",
			"x": -4000,
			"y": 3424,
			"width": 1078,
			"height": 513
		},
		{
			"id": "ea931bc2366f832e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "ANS 1,4\n\n第二個選項是三次加四次減法\n![[Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/01-計算機組織TOPIC 07 08乘法運算.png]]\n第三個選項 Booth's 不一定會比傳統來的少，平均來說是但是不是一定",
			"x": -1767,
			"y": 784,
			"width": 501,
			"height": 291
		},
		{
			"id": "a4a490849e9a5cc2",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/15-計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算.png",
			"x": -2720,
			"y": 3419,
			"width": 1479,
			"height": 545
		},
		{
			"id": "8f5988d07c245777",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "整體精神",
			"x": 495,
			"y": 3399,
			"width": 123,
			"height": 50,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "9a0b2594d38522e9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Comb 的電路他的成本就是比較高，速度快",
			"x": -473,
			"y": 4280,
			"width": 533,
			"height": 73,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "c301f890e2c3f55b",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/11-Booth's Algo.png",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 2500,
			"width": 602,
			"height": 418
		},
		{
			"id": "7ad66f293ac75fc2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 優點： \n\t1. 可以做有號數乘法\n\t2. 平均速度比較快於傳統式和 Hardware friendy\n- 特例：\n\t 1. Worst 的狀態 010101 是最差的狀態也就是 01 交錯，因為 10 交錯會少做一次\n\t2. Best 就是全部都是 1 課本給的，全零不太算是因為硬體可以提前知道就直接 return 0",
			"x": 1340,
			"y": 3040,
			"width": 580,
			"height": 240,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "e08840d25a655547",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/14-Booth's Algo - 整體精神.png",
			"x": 661,
			"y": 3291,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 266
		},
		{
			"id": "11165deb0ce42ecb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "在 Booth’s 演算法裡，我們只看 **乘數最低位 Q0** 和 **上一輪的 Q-1**：\n\n- **00**：沒變化，區間內都是 0，不做事。\n    \n- **11**：沒變化，區間內都是 1，延續，不做事。\n    \n- **01**：從 0 → 1 的變化，表示「一段 1 區間開始」 → 要 **+M**。\n    \n- **10**：從 1 → 0 的變化，表示「一段 1 區間結束」 → 要 **-M**。",
			"x": 495,
			"y": 3040,
			"width": 566,
			"height": 178,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "767e832446a488d3",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/10-Booth's Algo.png",
			"x": 355,
			"y": 2500,
			"width": 844,
			"height": 470
		},
		{
			"id": "e8f9336a9c0ff5bf",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/12-Booth's Algo.png",
			"x": -220,
			"y": 2587,
			"width": 399,
			"height": 296
		},
		{
			"id": "2ae2972d87d3afb9",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/03-Hardware Friendly.png",
			"x": 1875,
			"y": 1185,
			"width": 379,
			"height": 244
		},
		{
			"id": "1d0931de827d1561",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "由上往下看 Control 連接的線\n1. Op Control 第一條線\n2. Load 是 1 才能把 ALU 結果載入到 Product\n3. 還有一個 shift enable \n4. 檢查 Multiplier 的最後一個 bit\n",
			"x": 1875,
			"y": 1502,
			"width": 379,
			"height": 177,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "9e608d83ee32793b",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "三個暫存器 \nmultiplicand\nmultiplier\nproduct",
			"x": 220,
			"y": 1340,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bf4c482d0bf4db3a",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/04-Hardware Friendly - 由上往下看 Control 連接的線.png",
			"x": 1280,
			"y": 1469,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 210
		},
		{
			"id": "5a025a0b01cccacc",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/07-Hardware Friendly - 由上往下看 Control 連接的線.png",
			"x": 1280,
			"y": 1785,
			"width": 599,
			"height": 340
		},
		{
			"id": "b703f75c12dcf58a",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/02-Hardware Friendly.png",
			"x": 1280,
			"y": 1028,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 225
		},
		{
			"id": "16db4db8c9c95bcb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "其實可以把 Multiplier 放到 Product 的右半邊因為都是向右移動，可以省空間",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": 1028,
			"width": 250,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "06d61adbe90e40e3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "32 bit 需要 31 個家法器，然後要有五層 $2^5$，五層只要 gate delay 5 層加器的電路",
			"x": -322,
			"y": 4533,
			"width": 353,
			"height": 115,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "8102ea095108a555",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/05-傳統式 - 三個暫存器.png",
			"x": 280,
			"y": 1561,
			"width": 501,
			"height": 359
		},
		{
			"id": "7c39953e7e574d24",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- 優點：iteration 次數變少\n- 缺點：硬體成本增加\n- 3 bits Booth's algo 不一定會比 2 bits 來的少次，但頻均來說是",
			"x": 2707,
			"y": 3280,
			"width": 513,
			"height": 94,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "b1a114a711671cbf",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/08-Booth's Algo Modify.png",
			"x": 2400,
			"y": 2380,
			"width": 872,
			"height": 494
		},
		{
			"id": "29c99bdceab76a84",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/06-傳統式 - 三個暫存器.png",
			"x": -260,
			"y": 1617,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 174
		},
		{
			"id": "9480ebc8df4a054f",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "傳統的就是 Multiplicand 一直往左移動然後如果是 1 的 Multiplier 就往下加如果是 0 就 do not think，Multiplicand 要八位因為他會一直往左所以要八位，然後 Multiplier 要往右移省電路空間和提升速度每次只看最後一位去判斷要不要加，Iteration 就是你 bit 數量",
			"x": -260,
			"y": 1340,
			"width": 400,
			"height": 160
		},
		{
			"id": "0e834a348799f8bc",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/17-Fast Multiplier - Fast 就是一加二加三.png",
			"x": 2387,
			"y": 4475,
			"width": 672,
			"height": 495
		},
		{
			"id": "e853b9a39bb1524f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/19-Fast Multiplier - Fast 就是一加二加三.png",
			"x": 1186,
			"y": 5063,
			"width": 772,
			"height": 360
		},
		{
			"id": "d547cb97c1aaf1de",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "- Fast 就是一加二加三",
			"x": 1387,
			"y": 4636,
			"width": 570,
			"height": 88,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "896e1091987a2acb",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "32 bit 快速乘法器，那麼 gate delay 31 個加法電路，因為第一個是輸入所以需要 -1",
			"x": 2459,
			"y": 5181,
			"width": 368,
			"height": 125
		},
		{
			"id": "a5cd5ee9737e8f6e",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "課本的電路設計都有問題，因為如果 Product 的  bit 數只有這樣，會 overflow 導致正數變負數，是不對的所以其實在真正的硬體上面應該要 +1 bit 才是正確的，但是不用管他還是照算",
			"x": 3799,
			"y": 3074,
			"width": 361,
			"height": 114,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "6f2b801092830b83",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/09-Booth's Algo Modify.png",
			"x": 3360,
			"y": 2445,
			"width": 799,
			"height": 182
		},
		{
			"id": "24a8c079d7a9850f",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/13-Booth's Algo Modify.png",
			"x": 3580,
			"y": 2677,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 328
		},
		{
			"id": "53f0a75cfa543078",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "-  Parallel Fast 就是兩兩相加",
			"x": 303,
			"y": 4871,
			"width": 482,
			"height": 85,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "e113e4ad9ad4e0b6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Current bits 兩個決定出來家或是減是兩倍，那麼 Previous 和一個 Current bits 是一倍，主要原因是因為 Product 他會位移所兩個 bits 所以就等於乘 2。\n\n也就是說 011，01 是代表要加兩倍 11 不用動所以，最後操作會有 Operation",
			"x": 2707,
			"y": 3060,
			"width": 493,
			"height": 165,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "19d3384e9296d3af",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Assets/Note/Research/計算機組織TOPIC_07_08乘法運算/18-Parallel Fast Multiplier - Parallel Fast 就是兩兩相加.png",
